Package: uzunyx-wallpapers
Version: @VERSION@
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: emi <285864120+antarest47@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: fonts-nunito, plasma-integration, sddm-theme-breeze, plasma-workspace (>= 4:6.7), layer-shell-qt, kwin-wayland
Conflicts: waifbian-wallpapers
Replaces: waifbian-wallpapers
Recommends: sddm
Description: Uzunyx wallpapers, lock screen and login screen
 Uzunyx wallpapers as Plasma wallpaper packages (Uzunyx Akane and Uzunyx Sora, their skies, and Uzunyx 1, 1 alt, 2 and
 2 alt). Sets "Uzunyx Akane (sky)" as the default lock screen wallpaper
 (/etc/xdg/kscreenlockerrc) and as the background of the "uzunyx" SDDM
 login theme, KDE's Breeze login theme with that background, made the
 active SDDM theme in /etc/sddm.conf.d/uzunyx.conf.
